Package: orna
Version: 0.1.0-1
Section: database
Priority: optional
Architecture: amd64
Maintainer: Kieran Drewett <kieran@drewett.dev>
Depends: libc6 (>= 2.36), libgcc-s1, systemd
Homepage: https://github.com/workingdir/ornadb
Description: OrnaDB database server
 OrnaDB is a typed database server with a statically linked private
 PostgreSQL engine. The package installs one product executable.
